ame":"鈴湯","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:123594","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"癸 乙夜","creatorId":"vndb:s2829","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2829","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2829","name":"癸乙夜","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:123595","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"高橋 麗子","creatorId":"vndb:s6842","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6842","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6842","name":"高橋 麗子","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:123596","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"とよ","creatorId":"vndb:s11878","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11878","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11878","name":"とよ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:123598","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"翡翠","creatorId":"vndb:s13319","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13319","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13319","name":"翡翠","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:123600","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c16861","characterName":"白羽 蘇芳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22546","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2990"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16861"},"originalCharacterName":"白羽 蘇芳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"316"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"73"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A quiet, anxious, timid girl—"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she is misunderstood; her beauty, which sets her apart from the herd, and her silence is seen as cool, and the timidity that prevents her from mixing with everyone is seen as independence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Before she came to the academy, she went to live with her grandfather due to her family situation, and was homeschooled, therefore she is not good at interacting with people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, it is not because she hates people; her desire to make friends is double that of most people. Also, she is extremely shy, and this in combination with her anxiety means that she always blushes when she gets nervous. Because books and movies are her friends, she has a habit of quoting lines from books and movies in her conversations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her Amitie partners are Mayuri and Rikka. Her interests are literature, music, and film."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16861"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で心配性で小心者――。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、群を抜く美人のためか言葉数が少ないのはクールだからとなり、小心者ゆえ人の輪に入れないことは、自立した確固たる個性を持つ少女だと勘違いされてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院に入るまでは家族間の事情から祖父と暮らし、学校も通信教育で行っていたため人付き合いが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし“人”が嫌いなのではなく、友人をつくりたいと思う気持ちは人一倍である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また非常に恥ずかしがり屋で、小心者の性格も相まって緊張するとすぐに赤面してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"映画や小説を友としていたため、会話の中で映画・小説の台詞を引用する癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アミティエは「匂坂マユリ」と「花菱立花」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は文学・音楽・映画鑑賞"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2990","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で心配性で小心者ーーーー"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、群を抜く美人のためか言葉数が少ないのはクールだからとなり、勘違いされてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院に入るまでは家族間の事情から祖父と暮らし、学校も通信教育で行っていたため人付き合いが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし“人”が嫌いなのでなく、友人をつくりたいと思う気持ちは人一倍である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また非常に恥ずかしがり屋で、小心者の性格もあいまって緊張するとすぐに赤面してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"映画や小説を友としていたため、会話の中で映画・小説の台詞を引用する癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アミティエは「匂坂マユリ」と「花菱立花」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は文学・音楽・映画鑑賞"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『花蘇芳(マメ科) 』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：「高貴」「質素」「不信仰」「裏切り」「疑惑」「豊かな生涯」「目覚め」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22546"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"兴趣","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22546","value":"读书、电影鉴赏"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2a96d8474f4305e0438c42cbed634e7fea0381eb2eab26c2134fe46a4d9db65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a64e562bac879215721fa71dd334e1821e4f4c07cbfe6f87ef1dd5bbf108a03.webp","width":142,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"名塚佳織","creatorId":"vndb:s2232","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2232","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2232","name":"名塚佳織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22546:3922:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16863","characterName":"花菱 立花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22554","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2989"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16863"},"originalCharacterName":"花菱 立花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"515"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"68"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"70"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"37"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very serious, calm girl who is good at taking care of others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is like the mother of the class; she is not only kind but when someone does something bad, she will say so, like a mother who is kind yet strict."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cherished for her thoughtfulness toward others, she stands at the heart of class with Mayuri Kousaka in terms of influence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because she was the top scoring student on the entrance exam, along with her caring and her ability to make things happen, she was named the class president."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She takes pride in the fact that she can handle all that is expected of her, takes initiative, and devotes herself to the role."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16863"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉（ハナビシソウ）：私の希望を叶えてください、私を拒絶しないで"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まじめで面倒見がいい穏やかな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスのお母さん的立場にあるが、ただ優しいだけでなく駄目なことはダメと言える優しくも厳しい母像。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その面倒見が良く穏やかな性格から慕われ、クラスの中心人物である匂坂マユリと同程度の影響力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学試験ではトップの成績であり、面倒見も良く行動力もあることから担任から直々にクラス委員長に指名される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も期待され応えられる自分に誇りを持っており、率先して役職に勤しむ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は紅茶の茶葉集め。淹れるのも飲むのも好きでお茶会を主催する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"蘇芳のアミティエの一人"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2989","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まじめで面倒見がいい穏やかな性格。クラスのお母さん的立場にあるが、ただ優しいだけでなく駄目なことはダメと言える優しくも厳しい母像。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その面倒見が良く穏やかな性格から慕われ、クラスの中心人物の匂坂マユリと同程度の影響力を持っている。入学試験ではトップの成績であり、面倒見もよく行動力もあることから担任から直々にクラス委員長に指名される。本人も期待され、応えられる自分に誇りを持っており率先して役職にいそしむ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は紅茶の茶葉集め。淹れるのも飲むのも好きでお茶会を主催する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"蘇芳のアミティエの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ハナビシソウ（ケシ科）』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：私の希望を叶えて下さい／私を拒絶しないで"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22554"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db9b6a5e16cfcfbb145ad0540417c8a3cc214c5013263fe05184f88eaf9bfb44.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d7cc727956384d35bfd7cfc4ccc281ac211a8b530d31d96d9fd9d51c750e916.webp","width":141,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"明島ゆうり","creatorId":"vndb:s3891","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3891","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3891","name":"赤井リア(赤井いちご)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22554:13367:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16864","characterName":"沙沙貴 苺","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22552","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2988"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16864"},"originalCharacterName":"沙沙貴 苺","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"413"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"67"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"68"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"49"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"37"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A troublemaker brimming with curiosity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It isn’t that she intentionally brings on disaster; her sheltered life means that she knows nothing, and so she naturally invites misunderstandings and trouble."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She started life at the boarding school with her twin sister, and overall is satisfied with all the novelty at the academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is cheery, so she speaks openly with the people around her, and gets along well with her classmates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is especially close with Mayuri Kohsaka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her interests are the latest fashions and collecting frog memorabilia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16864"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心旺盛なトラブルメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意図して災いを振りまくのではなく、箱入り娘だったため何も知らないがゆえに誤解と衝突をまねいてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双子の妹と共に寮生活をスタートさせたが、学院生活は目新しい物が多くおおむね満足している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい性格であるため周囲ともすぐに打ち解け、クラスメイトとの仲は良好である。特に匂坂マユリと仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は流行り物とカエルの置物集め"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2988","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心旺盛なトラブルメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意図して災いを振りまくのではなく、箱入り娘だったため何も知らないがゆえに誤解と衝突をまねいてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双子の妹とともに寮生活をスタートさせたが学院生活は目新しい物が多くおおむね満足している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい性格であるため周囲ともすぐに打ち解け、クラスメイトとの仲は良好である。特に匂坂マユリと仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は流行り物とカエルの置物集め。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『苺（バラ科）』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：尊敬と愛"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22552"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/394512a2c045b2a2d748f839d7ed4f6a7cb8618173b43205b8c0919a32783246.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a4954d69e5fcc562b1fb5bb906193d3fe9b322f244824f56e158f0e67d2da20.webp","width":221,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長妻樹里","creatorId":"vndb:s1197","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1197","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1197","name":"長妻 樹里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22552:8493:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16865","characterName":"沙沙貴 林檎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22551","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2992"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16865"},"originalCharacterName":"沙沙貴 林檎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"413"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"67"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"68"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"49"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"37"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is often thought to be the laidback opposite of her bubbly sister... but in truth she is just a bit lazy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"People who know her for a long time come to see her eccentric personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Perhaps because she is an eccentric and is not afraid of anything, she speaks freely with Suoh, who most people regard as unapproachable, and the two quickly became acquaintances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Perhaps they are drawn to each other because of their love of books…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her interests are reading and ghost stories."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16865"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"快活な姉とは真逆のおっとりした性格……と思われるが実は怠け癖がついているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長く付き合っていくうちに変わり者としての性格が見えてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変わり者で物怖じしない性格ゆえかクラスでは高嶺の花となっている蘇芳にも気負わずに話しかけ、すぐに知人程度の付き合いにはなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お互い本好きという面が惹かれ合うのか……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書と怪談話"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2992","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"快活な姉とは真逆のおっとりとした性格……と思われるが実は怠け癖がついているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長く付き合っていくうちに変わり者としての性格が見えてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変わり者で物怖じしない性格ゆえかクラスでは高嶺の花となっている蘇芳にも気負わずに話しかけ、すぐに知人程度の付き合いにはなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お互い本好きという面が惹かれあうのか……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書と怪談話。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『林檎（バラ科）』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：名声／選択／評判／選ばれた恋"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22551"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b8ccad49efa8007fa4ab4f491ec009183922402653af1c58139ddecfdba4c2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97a2168b663fe55b6761f685bed878c65ff0cd3cca6be9dafcd18392d60dea14.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長妻樹里","creatorId":"vndb:s1197","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1197","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1197","name":"長妻 樹里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22551:8493:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16866","characterName":"八代 譲葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22548","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2993"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16866"},"originalCharacterName":"八代 譲葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"106"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eccentric and dynamic. Because of her way of speaking and the randomness of the things she says, she is thought to be strange, but that is her world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is thought to be egotistic, but perhaps because she is the president of organizations, she is good at looking out for and taking care of others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though her words and actions are theatrical, her position as the president of the Council of Nicaea gives her a kind of dignity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is well trusted by all students at the academy. She is childhood friends with Nerine Komikado, the vice president of the Council of Nicaea, whom she calls Neri."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she belongs to the cooking club, she is terrible at cooking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her interests are sports and photography."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16866"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エキセントリックで行動的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"話し方や話題がとびとびになるため変わっているように思われるがそれも彼女の世界。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"我が強く思われがちだが、組織の長を務めているゆえか周りに目を配り気遣いのできる好人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動や行動が芝居がかってはいるものの、ニカイアの会の会長としての立場からある種の威厳として取られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院生徒からの信頼は厚く熱狂的。ニカイアの会の副会長、小御門ネリネとは幼なじみであり、彼女をネリーとあだ名で呼ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理部に所属しているものの料理下手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味はスポーツ観戦と写真"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2993","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エキセントリックで行動的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"話し方や話題がとびとびになるため変わってるように思われるがそれも彼女の世界。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"我が強く思われがちだが、組織の長を務めているゆえか周りに目を配り気遣いのできる好人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動や行動が芝居がかってはいるものの、ニカイアの会の会長としての立場からある種の威厳として取られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院生徒からの信頼は厚く熱狂的。ニカイアの会の副会長、小御門ネリネとは幼なじみであり、彼女をネリーとあだ名で呼ぶ。料理部に所属しているものも料理下手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味はスポーツ観戦と写真"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ユズリハ(ユズリハ科)』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉:「若返り」「世代交代」「譲渡」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22548"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f7e354321bb5a06cc935103668cc84c3f70db8a03aa8b8874b604836059cf1a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/0099f2d2569e1efe6feabd9be2a09d4b4b8804613924738ee110b2f5d886a04e.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22548:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16867","characterName":"小御門 ネリネ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22547","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2987"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16867"},"originalCharacterName":"小御門 ネリネ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1017"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A virtuous and gentle Catholic girl who is good with people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her otherworldly beauty and the fact that she is half-European builds a natural wall around her, making her a bit unapproachable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes to be spoiled but she does not show this side to just anybody."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the vice president of the Council of Nicaea and childhood friends with the Council’s president, Yuzuriha Yatsushiro."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Their closeness is such that at one point there were unsubstantiated rumors that she and Yuzuriha Yatsushiro were in a relationship. She belongs to the choir and is the club president. She is a soprano. Her interests are scary stories and walking while eating."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a bottomless pit when it comes to sweets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16867"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カトリックの教義に従い善良かつ温和な人の良い好人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハーフであり現実離れした美しい容姿を持つことから、自然と壁を作られ接せられることが悩み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えたがりの面もあるが誰にも地を出せないのが現状。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ニカイアの会の副会長であり、会長の八代譲葉とは幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一時期、八代譲葉との交際の噂もあったようだが根拠のない噂止まり程度だったよう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"合唱部に在籍しており部長を任されている。担当はソプラノ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は怖い話収拾に、食べ歩き。スイーツは底なし。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2987","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カトリックの教義に従い善良かつ温和な人の良い好人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハーフであり現実離れした美しい容姿を持つことから、自然と壁を作られ接せられることが悩み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えたがりの面もあるが、誰にも地を出せないのが現状。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ニカイアの会の副会長であり、会長の八代譲葉とは幼なじみ。一時期、八代譲葉との交際の噂もあったようだが根拠のない噂どまり程度だったよう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"合唱部に在籍しており部長を任せられている。担当はソプラノ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は怖い話収拾に、食べ歩き。スイーツは底なし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ネリネ（ヒガンバナ科）』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：華やか／また会う日を楽しみに／幸せな思い出／輝き／忍耐／箱入り娘"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22547"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9da44cc0a27af5975b7835a3b7445d1ead4c8d8020a03687c3637cf1074492b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d9f9dbc584543c5d0be4c6881e4cb867a8c2c5bb7e6b7f275c10ed809abf4cf.webp","width":157,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西口有香","creatorId":"vndb:s24","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24","name":"西口 有香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22547:6592:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16868","characterName":"ダリア バスキア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22549","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2994"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16868"},"originalCharacterName":"ダリア バスキア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"902"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the nuns at Saint Angraecum Academy. She is a mild and tolerant teacher, and is more like a laidback older sister than a mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because she is a strict follower of Catholicism, she has a tendency to apply her religion to things that have nothing to do with it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is in charge of the ballet lessons for the first year students and is well trusted by them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Thinking that she should turn her attention toward something other than religion, she has recently been raising her namesake flower, the dahlia, in the greenhouse and creating new varieties by her own hand."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her interests are ballet and gardening."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16868"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖アングレカム学院教師兼シスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで包容力のある教諭だが、母というよりもおっとりした姉といった風。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳格なカトリック教徒ゆえ宗教絡みではひかないものの、他の事柄では融通を利かせてしまう面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年生の担任でありバレエの指導もこなし生徒からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宗教以外に目を向けたほうがいいとのことで最近は、学院の温室にて自分の名前と同じ花、ダリアを育て、新しい品種を自分の手で作り上げようと生育している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味はバレエとガーデニング"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2994","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖アングレカム学院教師兼シスター。穏やかで包容力のある教諭だが、母というよりもおっとりした姉といった風。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳格なカトリック教徒ゆえ宗教がらみではひかないものの、他の事柄ではまま融通を利かせてしまう面も。一年生の担任でありバレエの指導もこなし生徒からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宗教以外に目を向けた方がいいとのことで、最近は学院温室にて自分の名前と同じ花、ダリアを育て、新しい品種を自分の手で作り上げようと生育している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味はバレエとガーデニング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ダリア（キク科）』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：移り気／華麗／優雅／威厳／不安定"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22549"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2c3136370139ae06fee897b6af2e9f7a277a3e9a47317025fd9dc73f602f4c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/2107a5b9001eb8e8dd2e9e4e52229bc44610175e52e1a15eb7bced3cb1f41727.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22549:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16869","characterName":"八重垣 えりか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22550","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2986"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16869"},"originalCharacterName":"八重垣 えりか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"917"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"69"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"65"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"38"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A strange, asocial girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She talks like a man, but this is her way of building a wall between herself and others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Generally she likes to be by herself, though she will speak to others to tease them. Her whimsical cat-like character makes her elusive."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"What part will she play in the tale… She is known as the girl in the wheelchair."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unable to move her legs due to illness, she lives her life in a wheelchair."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her interests are reading and finding people’s weak points."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Jast USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16869"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人嫌いの変わり者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性的なしゃべり方をするが、これも人と自分との間に壁を持ちたいがゆえ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本として一人を好むものの、からかうためなら相手に声を掛けることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫のような気まぐれな性格なため掴み所がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たしてどのような形で物語に絡んでくるのか……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通称・車椅子の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病気で足が動かせず車椅子にて生活をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書と人の弱み探し。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2986","sourceWorkId":"19981","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人嫌いの変わり者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性的なしゃべり方をするが、これも他者との間に壁を持ちたいが故。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人を好むものの、からかう為には話しかけにもいく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"白羽蘇芳とは書痴仲間であり、互いに好きな作家を紹介し合うなど唯一胸襟を開く間柄である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"書痴仲間のアミティエである匂坂マユリが学院を辞めたことで心を痛めているのではと、内心心配している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書と人の弱み探し。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『エリカ（ツツジ科）』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花言葉：「孤独」「謙遜」「休息」「心地好い言葉」「博愛」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22550"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa9bc0548dd258fdc75b7ad1ab94fa39902b628922f2a9f845804a9a527a162a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/5058cf4801ea5bd85021efe50048cefa2c08ca3b12a1363d5d7ac56341330655.webp","width":182,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉綾音","creatorId":"vndb:s3892","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3892","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3892","name":"佐倉 綾音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167531:22550:5745:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c22037","characterName":"考崎 千鳥","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c22037"},"originalCharacterName":"考崎 千鳥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"201"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"39"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An eccentric ballet celebrity. Thought of as unapproachable since her emotions don't show on her face, she often causes unnecessary drama because of her tendency to ask questions about things she shouldn't. She'll express herself honestly when it comes to things she's interested in. Other than that, she doesn't do anything unnecessary."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Before entering the academy, she was involved in the entertainment industry, predominantly theater, and so is one of the best in the school at ballet and singing"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is assigned as Erika's Amitié partner, but their mutual eccentricities lead to them often being at odds with one another."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobbies are classical ballet and voice training."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Benichidori (Rosaceae family)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Language of Flowers: How Lovely Refinement Nobility Devotion"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official page and Japanese official page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22037"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d1cdaf6dce0423456d7b91bfe9862a0886128d3c493805018f01832eaf585c88.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43154273f0437f46449988f9089a13f5349cb84bcbcf0344416cc6346feb1daa.webp","width":177,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"洲崎 綾","creatorId":"vndb:s3893","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3893","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3893","name":"洲崎 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:65954","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p26","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1866","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p26","name":"PROTOTYPE","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:28470:1866","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p102","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p102","name":"JAST USA","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":